Docker Installation
=============
I followed the below step to install docker 
   1) Install the dnf-plugins-core package
      sudo dnf -y install dnf-plugins-core
      sudo dnf config-manager --add-repo https://download.docker.com/linux/centos/docker-ce.repo
      
   2) To install the latest version of docker engine 
      sudo dnf install docker-ce docker-ce-cli containerd.io docker-buildx-plugin docker-compose-plugin
      
   3) Enable the docker service 
      sudo systemctl enable --now docker
      
   4) Above steps will automaticcaly creates the docker group so give the permission to user 
      sudo usermod -aG docker <username>
      
   5) verify the docker installation with docker --version command  
                   
Use the below link for the reference 
https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/centos/
   
